  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda Biodiversity Fund (UBF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Uganda):  USAID&apos;s Uganda Biodiversity Fund (UBF) Activity aims to ensure that the Fund is a reputable, well-functioning, and sustainable conservation trust fund that is responsive to Uganda&apos;s conservation and natural resources management financing needs. UBF&apos;s mission is to catalyze, mobilize, and manage financial resources for biodiversity conservation and sustainable use of natural resources in Uganda..The Activity will use FY 2022 funds to: 1) further build UBF into an effective and efficient national conservation trust fund; 2) implement a grants program, including using funds mobilized from the private sector and other donors, to deliver impactful conservation in Uganda; and 3) strengthen partnerships and coordination among national and local actors that support locally-led, sustainable development..</narrative>
  </description>
